sequenceDiagram
    actor Designer as Workflow Designer
    participant UI as Angular SPA
    participant API as Workflow API
    participant Engine as Runtime Engine
    participant Handler as Task Handler (mock)
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Designer->>UI: Build workflow graph
    UI->>API: POST /definitions
    API->>DB: Save WorkflowDefinition (versioned)
    Designer->>UI: Launch simulation
    UI->>API: POST /instances
    API->>Engine: Start WorkflowInstance
    Engine->>DB: Create instance + initial NodeExecution
    loop Until End node
        Engine->>Engine: Evaluate current node(s)
        alt Task node
            Engine->>Handler: InvokeAsync(context, callback)
            Handler-->>Engine: NotifyCompletedAsync(result)
        end
        Engine->>DB: Record NodeExecution / advance state
    end
    UI->>API: GET /instances/{id}
    API->>DB: Read instance + history
    API-->>UI: Instance state + execution history
    UI-->>Designer: Render graph with node status
